    "detailed_description": "Experience a compelling tale in just an hour!<br />\r\nIntroducing the inaugural installment of the &quot;Handy Novel&quot; series.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDive into the twisted fate of a man who time-traveled with a mission - to kill his past self.<br />\r\n\u2022 A minimalist visual novel game, served up with just text and BGM<br />\r\n\u2022 Designed to reach all endings in about an hour - perfect for a quick break or insomnia nights<br />\r\nIndulge in a unique reading-gaming hybrid experience!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis PC/Mac version retains the original content of its highly-rated smartphone counterpart (free to download, donation-based), now optimized for a seamless desktop experience.",
    "about_the_game": "Experience a compelling tale in just an hour!<br />\r\nIntroducing the inaugural installment of the &quot;Handy Novel&quot; series.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDive into the twisted fate of a man who time-traveled with a mission - to kill his past self.<br />\r\n\u2022 A minimalist visual novel game, served up with just text and BGM<br />\r\n\u2022 Designed to reach all endings in about an hour - perfect for a quick break or insomnia nights<br />\r\nIndulge in a unique reading-gaming hybrid experience!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis PC/Mac version retains the original content of its highly-rated smartphone counterpart (free to download, donation-based), now optimized for a seamless desktop experience.",
